        "text": "6"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "B",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Find the hits",
        "body": "Each dart that hits scores 5, 8 or 14. Ways to make 32:\n\n- $8 + 8 + 8 + 8 = 32$ (4 darts)\n- $14 + 8 + 5 + 5 = 32$ (4 darts)\n\nNo other way works (see the next solution). Either way 4 darts hit, so $7 - 4 = 3$ missed.\n\n**Answer: (B) 3**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Count the 5s",
        "body": "32 is even, so the number of 5-point hits is even: 0, 2, 4 or 6.\n\n- No 5s: 32 from 8s and 14s → $8 \\times 4$ (4 hits).\n- Two 5s: 22 left → $14 + 8$ (4 hits).\n- Four 5s: 12 left — impossible. Six 5s: 30, leaves 2 — impossible.\n\nSo always 4 hits and 3 misses.\n\n**Answer: (B) 3**"
      }
    ],
